# The loop-break hit sounds (src/sound.c): records the game's sound (/out/sound.wav) while three
# direction presses hit the loop, 3 s apart, to check each sound plays at the right speed and
# straight away. The press times show in the log (shots).
record_sound
wait 28 # boot, then the sounds load from the CD
press start
press a
press start
wait 2
shot press1
press left
wait 3
shot press2
press up
wait 3
shot press3
press right
wait 3
